E --> G{Process Termination}
E --> H{Reduce Max Usage}
E --> I{Decrease Room Temp}
F & G & H & I --> D
```

**Conclusion:**

The observed temperature rise is likely due to increased processor load. Implementing the proposed actions can effectively mitigate temperature peaks and maintain optimal processor performance.

